      "content": "i know what you're saying, but it doesn't change the math. every day is just more money spent on my care and more hours they spend worrying about me. if i weren't here, they could finally breathe. they could actually move forward with their lives instead of being stuck in this loop of taking care of me. it almost feels like the most selfless thing i could do would be to just not be a problem anymore.",
